Deconjugator rules and algorithm — Apache License 2.0
https://github.com/Sirush/Jiten

hoshidicts' deconjugator is a port of Jiten's, and the rule set in
vendor/src/deconjugator/deconjugation_rules.hpp is Jiten's
Shared/resources/deconjugator.json.

Apache-2.0 requires that this attribution and a copy of the licence travel with
redistributions, and that modified files carry prominent notices of change. The
rules file is modified downstream of Jiten: the single raw string literal is
split into adjacent literals so MSVC will compile it (see
patches/0001-msvc-split-string-literal.patch). The change is mechanical and
alters no rule.

