Dictionary format — Yomitan
https://github.com/yomidevs/yomitan (GPL-3.0)

The `.zip` layout this crate imports, and the "structured content" glossary
format it returns, are Yomitan's. No Yomitan code is used, copied or linked —
only the data format is shared, and the importer is an independent
implementation. This credit is given because the format is Yomitan's work, not
because GPL-3.0 obligations attach.

Anyone rendering structured content must write their own renderer. Yomitan's is
GPL-3.0 and cannot be copied into an MIT codebase.

